# Netlify redirects for oleo.com.au
# Processed top-to-bottom; first match wins.

# Force www -> non-www (catch-all)
https://www.oleo.com.au/*   https://oleo.com.au/:splat   301!

# 9 legacy URLs from the previous oleo.com.au site, surfaced as 404s in
# Google Search Console. Send them all to the homepage so the link
# equity is preserved and Google can drop them from the index.
/service              /   301
/order-confirmation   /   301
/paypal-checkout      /   301
/product/*            /   301
/category/*           /   301
